Inspired-by lineage
-------------------

The manifest records three upstream projects under
`project.attribution.lineage`. Each is recorded as `relationship: inspired-by`:
they contributed a CONCEPT or a MORPHOLOGY — an arrangement of joints, a choice
of where to put the motors, a way of thinking about the arm — and contributed
NO geometry and NO code to this cartridge. The licences below are recorded for
completeness and traceability, not because any of them reaches this work.
Licences read on 2026-09-05.

